# Input

```css
:root {
	--main-font-stack:
		/* Why does this comment get placed without indentation? */
		system-ui,
		/* Comment 1 */
		-apple-system,
		BlinkMacSystemFont,
		/* Comment 2 */
		"Segoe UI",
		Roboto, Ubuntu,
		/* Comment 3 */
		sans-serif;
}

```


# Formatted

```css
:root {
	--main-font-stack:
		/* Why does this comment get placed without indentation? */
		system-ui, /* Comment 1 */ -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
		/* Comment 2 */ "Segoe UI", Roboto, Ubuntu, /* Comment 3 */ sans-serif;
}

```
